  "title": "VAREX SCHEDULES SECOND QUARTER FISCAL YEAR 2026 EARNINGS RELEASE AND CONFERENCE CALL",
  "summary": "SALT LAKE CITY, April 22, 2026 – Varex Imaging Corporation (Nasdaq: VREX) today announced that it will report unaudited financial results for the second quarter of fiscal year 2026, following the close of regular trading on Thursday, May 7, 2026. The earnings news release will be followed by a conference call at 3:00 pm Mountain Time […]",
